      "text": "```\nFALKENMARK WATER STRESS INDICATOR (1989):\n  Per capita renewable freshwater availability:\n    > 1,700 m³/person/yr: water sufficient\n    1,000–1,700 m³/person/yr: water stress\n    500–1,000 m³/person/yr: water scarcity\n    < 500 m³/person/yr: absolute scarcity"
    },
