      "text": "FALKENMARK'S BLUE WATER SCARCITY (Hoekstra et al.):\n  Monthly water scarcity: demand exceeds supply in specific months\n  Accounts for seasonal variability — more realistic than annual averages\n  Result: 500 million people face year-round scarcity;\n          4 billion face at least 1 month/yr of severe scarcity"
