      "text": "TYPES OF WATER SCARCITY:\n  Physical scarcity: not enough water in the basin\n    → parts of Middle East, Central Asia, S. Australia, W. US\n  Economic scarcity: water exists but lack infrastructure/investment to use it\n    → sub-Saharan Africa (paradox: Congo River basin water-rich but population water-poor)\n  Institutional scarcity: governance failure, corruption, lack of water rights systems\n    → widespread in developing world\n```"
